    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · resolve effects at the table</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>You press a familiar image toward your companion: a face, a hearth, the feel of a hand. Their attention catches on it.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Reaction</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>None (no roll)</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>Self or one visible willing ally within 3 squares immediately after temporary Dazed is applied.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Magic / Recovery</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>Reduce the newly applied temporary Dazed contribution by 1.</p></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/c5c84c0da3a5bd54b2553426408d1ea581fe22b9/design/cards/name-what-is-real.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/name-what-is-real.md</a> at <code>c5c84c0da3a5bd54b2553426408d1ea581fe22b9</code>.</p></section>",
